  To consider and approve the Standalone & Consolidated Un-audited Financial Results of the Company for the Quarter and half year ended on 30th September, 2026 in terms of regulation 33 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015 and to take on record the Limited Review Report thereon; 
  Other ancillary and routine businesses.
